00:08:43.195 --> 00:08:47.333
&gt;&gt; Laura: IS THAT RELEVANT?

00:08:45.431 --> 00:08:49.735
GIVES YOU ATTORNEY CLIENT

00:08:47.466 --> 00:08:50.936
PRIVILEGE --

00:08:49.869 --> 00:08:54.407
&gt;&gt; IT HELPS TO UNDERSTAND WHAT

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:56.709
HE DID TO GET THE MEMOS OUT.

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:58.177
IT WAS A STUNNING RE-LATION.

00:08:56.842 --> 00:08:59.078
COMEY DOES NOT CONSIDER WHAT HE

00:08:58.310 --> 00:09:02.648
DID LEAKING.

00:08:59.211 --> 00:09:05.317
HE HAS REDEFINED LEAKING TO MEAN

00:09:02.782 --> 00:09:05.718
ONLY DISCLOSES CLASSIFIED

00:09:05.451 --> 00:09:07.253
INFORMATION.

00:09:05.851 --> 00:09:09.021
HE BELIEVES -- HE'S SAID SEVERAL

00:09:07.386 --> 00:09:10.923
TIMES THAT HE DIDN'T LEAK WHEN

00:09:09.155 --> 00:09:12.658
HE GAVE THIS MEMO TO DAN RICHMAN

00:09:11.057 --> 00:09:13.459
FOR THE PURPOSE OF RICHMAN

00:09:12.792 --> 00:09:14.493
TELLING THE "NEW YORK TIMES"

00:09:13.592 --> 00:09:15.995
ABOUT IT.

00:09:14.627 --> 00:09:16.829
COMEY MAINTAINS THAT THIS WAS

00:09:16.128 --> 00:09:18.097
NOT A LEAK.

00:09:16.962 --> 00:09:19.999
HE ALSO SAID IT COULDN'T HAVE

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:22.935
BEEN A LEAK BECAUSE HE LEFT THE

00:09:20.132 --> 00:09:24.336
FBI AND WAS NO LONGER A

00:09:23.069 --> 00:09:27.473
GOVERNMENT EMPLOYEE.

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:29.608
&gt;&gt; GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS WROTE A

00:09:27.606 --> 00:09:31.343
BOOK ABOUT CONVERSATIONS WITH

00:09:29.742 --> 00:09:34.346
BILL CLINTON.

00:09:31.477 --> 00:09:35.714
SCOTT McCLELLAND BROKE A BOOK --

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.048
&gt;&gt; AFTER THEY WERE OUT OF

00:09:35.848 --> 00:09:37.016
OFFICE.

00:09:36.182 --> 00:09:38.517
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE CASE.

00:09:37.149 --> 00:09:42.955
THAT COMEY WAS OUT OF OFFICE AND

00:09:38.651 --> 00:09:47.526
HE WAS NO MORE OF A LEAKER THAN

00:09:43.089 --> 00:09:47.343
GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS OR Mc

00:09:47.343 --> 00:09:50.696
GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS OR M

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:51.897
McCLELLAND WAS.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.766
&gt;&gt; THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT KEPT

00:09:52.031 --> 00:09:54.100
THEM AS IF THEY WERE STATE

00:09:53.899 --> 00:09:55.801
SECRETS.

00:09:54.233 --> 00:09:56.102
FEW MEMBERS WERE ALLOWED TO SEE

00:09:55.935 --> 00:09:57.536
THEM.

00:09:56.235 --> 00:09:57.970
YOU HAD DO HAVE AN FBI MINDER

00:09:57.670 --> 00:10:00.039
WITH THEM.

00:09:58.104 --> 00:10:02.174
NO NOTES, NO COPIES.

00:10:00.172 --> 00:10:03.476
&gt;&gt; Laura: IT'S CONTRARY TO

00:10:02.308 --> 00:10:04.577
JUSTICE DEPARTMENT

00:10:03.609 --> 00:10:06.278
REGULATIONS --

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:08.114
&gt;&gt; NOBODY ON CAPITOL HILL

00:10:06.412 --> 00:10:09.281
BELIEVES THIS IS THE ONLY LEAK

00:10:08.247 --> 00:10:09.615
THAT JAMES COMEY DID THERE

00:10:09.415 --> 00:10:12.051
RICHMAN.

00:10:09.748 --> 00:10:15.221
I MANY GUESS IS THERE WERE TONS.

00:10:12.184 --> 00:10:15.554
HE HAD EMPLOYEES WITH THE SGE

00:10:15.354 --> 00:10:18.324
STATUS.

00:10:15.688 --> 00:10:18.624
I'M GUESSING HE DID LOTS OF

